  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The product of two positive integers is <math alttext=\"462\"><mn>462</mn>\n</math>. If the first integer is <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math> greater than twice the second integer, what is the smaller of the two integers?</p>",
